@startuml
title Safehome Security Function State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
Idle : do / check if everything is working upon power-on

state ProblemDuringStartup
ProblemDuringStartup : do / stop if there is a problem during startup

state ReadyToUse
ReadyToUse : do / become ready to use if everything is fine during startup

state Reset
Reset : do / allow the user to reset it when it is ready to use

state Activate
Activate : do / allow the user to activate it when it is ready to use

state TurnOff
TurnOff : do / allow the user to turn it off when it is ready to use

state Monitoring
Monitoring : do / start monitoring if it is activated

state AlarmTriggered
AlarmTriggered : do / start the alarm and send alerts if a sensor is triggered during monitoring

state FalseAlarmOrTimeEnds
FalseAlarmOrTimeEnds : do / continue monitoring if it turns out to be a false alarm or the time ends

state Normal
Normal : do / stop and return to normal when the user enters the password at any time
@enduml
